namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTileView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTileView.h#DreamTileView
    src   "A tile view whose hierarchy is code, not an asset: a list whose rows are laid out across as well\nas down.\n\nUMG's TileView derives from its ListView and adds an entry WIDTH; this is the same relationship,\nfor the same reason. Everything that makes a list -- the viewport, the bar, the scrolled column,\nthe row template, the pool, the selection, the recycling threshold -- is UDreamListViewBase's and\nis not restated here. What a tile view adds is one question answered differently: how many rows sit\nside by side.\n\nTHE COLUMN COUNT IS MEASURED, NOT AUTHORED\n------------------------------------------\nUMG's tile view fits as many entries across as the width allows and re-flows when it changes, and\nso does this one: ResolveColumnCount divides the viewport by the tile pitch. An authored count\nwould be a second number that has to agree with the width, and the first resize would end that\nagreement -- the same equation-in-two-places the row placement was rewritten to remove.\n\nA floor of one, always: a viewport narrower than a tile shows one tile per line and clips it,\nwhich is visible and recoverable, where zero columns is a division by zero and a blank control.\n\nWHAT A TILE'S SIZE IS\n---------------------\nIts height is FDreamListStyle::RowHeight -- the SAME field a list's row height comes from, because\nit is the same measurement -- and its width is FDreamTileViewStyle::TileWidth. There is no aspect\nlock and no \"square\" flag: two numbers already say every shape those flags could, and a lock would\nmake one of the two unreadable in the panel.\n\nSee UDreamListViewBase for the rest, and UDreamListView for the flat case."
    text  "一种层级由代码而非资产构建的平铺视图：一种行既横向排布\n又纵向排布的列表。\n\nUMG的TileView派生自其ListView，并增加了一个条目WIDTH；此处是同样的关系，\n出于同样的原因。构成列表的一切——视口、滚动条、可滚动的列、\n行模板、对象池、选择、回收阈值——都归UDreamListViewBase所有，\n此处不再赘述。平铺视图所增加的，是一个以不同方式回答的问题：有多少行\n并排。\n\n列数是测量出来的，不是创作出来的\n------------------------------------------\nUMG的平铺视图按宽度尽可能多地横向容纳条目，并在宽度变化时重新排布，\n本视图也是如此：ResolveColumnCount用平铺间距来除视口。创作出来的数量\n会是第二个数字，必须与宽度保持一致，而第一次调整尺寸就会终结这种\n一致——而行摆放被重写，正是为了消除这种“同一个等式写在两处”。\n\n下限始终为一：视口比一个平铺还窄时，每行显示一个平铺并将其裁剪，\n这是可见且可恢复的；而零列则意味着除以零和一个空白控件。\n\n平铺的尺寸是什么\n---------------------\n它的高度是FDreamListStyle::RowHeight——列表行高所用的同一个字段，因为\n它们是同一个测量——而宽度则是FDreamTileViewStyle::TileWidth。没有宽高比\n锁定，也没有“正方形”标记：两个数字已经能表达那些标记所能表达的一切，而锁定会\n让两者之一在面板中无法读取。\n\n其余内容参见UDreamListViewBase，扁平的情形参见UDreamListView。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileView:bWrapHorizontalNavigation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTileView.h#DreamTileView:bWrapHorizontalNavigation
    src   "Whether stepping off the end of a line lands on the next one -- UMG's bWrapHorizontalNavigation.\n\nAnswered by INDEX rather than by geometry: \"the tile after this one\" is a fact about the\nsource, and the geometric navigator would have to infer it from rects that say nothing about\nwhich line they are on. A navigation press on a tile is answered by GetNavigationTarget, so this\nreaches the player as well as the API. Off by default, as UMG's is: a press off the end of a line\nthen leaves the tile view for whatever is beside it."
    text  "从一行末尾移出时，是否会落到下一行——即UMG的bWrapHorizontalNavigation。\n\n这由索引而非几何来回答：“此后的那个平铺”是关于\n源的事实，而几何导航器只能从矩形去推断，那些矩形并不说明\n它们位于哪一行。平铺上的导航按下由GetNavigationTarget回答，因此这\n不仅作用于API，也抵达玩家。默认关闭，与UMG一致：此时从一行末尾按下，\n会离开平铺视图，转到它旁边的任何控件。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileView:GetColumnCount {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTileView.h#DreamTileView:GetColumnCount
    src   "How many tiles fit across the viewport right now: the measured answer the layout is using.\n\nPublic because it is the one thing about a tile view a consumer cannot work out for itself --\nthe viewport's width is the control's business -- and because a test that cannot see it can\nonly assert positions, which is the same claim written less clearly."
    text  "当前视口横向能容纳多少个图块：布局正在使用的实测结果。\n\n之所以公开，是因为这是使用方唯一无法自行推算的图块视图信息——\n视口宽度是控件自己的事——也因为看不到它的测试\n只能断言位置，那是同一个结论的较不清晰写法。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileView:GetEntryHeight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTileView.h#DreamTileView:GetEntryHeight
    src   "A tile's height -- UMG's EntryHeight, which is FDreamListStyle::RowHeight here because it is\nthe same measurement a list's row height is. One tile, one size, and the style holds it."
    text  "图块的高度——即UMG的EntryHeight，在这里是FDreamListStyle::RowHeight，因为它与列表行高是\n同一个度量。一个图块，一个尺寸，由样式持有。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileView:GetEntryWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTileView.h#DreamTileView:GetEntryWidth
    src   "A tile's width -- UMG's EntryWidth, which is FDreamTileViewStyle::TileWidth."
    text  "图块的宽度——即UMG的EntryWidth，在这里是FDreamTileViewStyle::TileWidth。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileView:GetNavigationTarget {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTileView.h#DreamTileView:GetNavigationTarget
    src   "The display index one step in a direction from InDisplayIndex, or INDEX_NONE for \"off the grid\".\n\nThe tile view's own answer, because a grid's neighbours are arithmetic: across is plus or minus\none WITHIN a line, down is plus or minus the column count. Wrapping is what happens at a line's\nends when bWrapHorizontalNavigation is on -- and it is exactly the step the geometric navigator\ncannot make, because the tile it should land on is at the opposite edge of the control.\n\nWhat a navigation press on a tile steps by, for the four directions STileView and SListView\nanswer: the tile it names is selected while bSelectItemOnNavigation is on and scrolled into view,\nand INDEX_NONE hands the press on. Next and Prev are no press's to step: a tile view is one Tab\nstop, which Tab and Shift+Tab leave (UDreamListViewBase::HandleRowNavigation). Their answer here is\nthe source order, which is the order Tab enters the view in -- at its first tile, or Shift+Tab at its\nlast, while nothing is selected (UDreamListViewBase::ResolveTabEntry)."
    text  "从InDisplayIndex沿某个方向走一步后的显示索引，若为“在网格之外”则为INDEX_NONE。\n\n这是图块视图自己的答案，因为网格的邻居是算术：横向是在一行之内加或减\n一，纵向是加或减列数。换行发生在bWrapHorizontalNavigation开启时一行的\n两端——而这正是几何导航器迈不出的一步，因为它该落到的图块位于控件的\n对侧边缘。\n\n图块上的导航按键按什么步进，对应STileView和SListView会应答的四个方向：\n它指名的图块在bSelectItemOnNavigation开启时会被选中并滚动到可见处，\n而INDEX_NONE则把按键继续传递下去。Next和Prev不归任何按键步进：图块视图\n是一个Tab停靠点，Tab和Shift+Tab会离开它（UDreamListViewBase::HandleRowNavigation）。\n它们在这里的答案是源顺序，也就是Tab进入视图的顺序——在第一个图块处进入，\n或在没有选中项时用Shift+Tab从最后一个图块进入（UDreamListViewBase::ResolveTabEntry）。"
    state machine
}

